{"steam_appid":1331510,"steam_name":"Battle Talent","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1331510/1527131545/daf8546607140a7ac32ee8573bce4909261d6cf0/1750672913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749444493","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153815/39d1519abd677c32730b8f3c61edf5e1f355ed52/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749444493","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/ss_bf1675f69f3b7b917951d5745b1950b08feb0a05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773991730","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/ss_31e99f6cd56f315b985636ce754d2aa7bc7674ed.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773991730","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/ss_12952caa07ab5a0a22f26782df110aa11f8bf9d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773991730","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/ss_6159ce1ad1f82f3c7eeba1f47b1a11cfc012dd9b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773991730","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/ss_c1cf8e2cd85f1fee43dd99096cf2c47be041ae92.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773991730"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/44d8fd68c46424b4eb4761752351d472.avif?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/e358a313ad827fc994daac4df310de49.webp?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Next-Gen of VR Sword-Fighting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Talent is a <strong>challenging physics-based roguelite sword-fighting </strong>game, you can create your own fighting style and experience unparalleled gameplay in a mega seamless procedural dungeon. With over 80 enemy variants, 100 weapons, and 60 perks, the possibilities are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your friends to take down enemies! Experience rich <strong>multiplayer</strong> interactions and create powerful combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.poster.avif?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.webm?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/53ced430fa817b3f7b7440cebd77a84a.mp4?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience thrilling physical combat with <strong>spell, melee, and ranged attacks</strong>. Beware, target the boss! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.poster.avif?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.webm?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/870898407c1746007842a7429119c2e3.mp4?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your talent points in <strong>Roguelike levels </strong>and unlock unexpected treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.poster.avif?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.webm?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/75488a7a358d0b915b06385cdfee4fa3.mp4?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> to experiment with <strong>2000+ mods</strong> and Scene Editor feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.poster.avif?t=1773991730\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.webm?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1331510/extras/dc82e205c1b1f1ddaae3aa415ffaf458.mp4?t=1773991730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 game modes: Adventure, Challenge, Sandbox,  Multiplayer Mode (PvE &amp; PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports multiplayer mode for 2-6 players and includes a built-in voice chat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in scripted mod menu with 2000+ mods, enhance your gaming experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrill of hack-and-slash with realistic physics interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of enemies and bosses, over 80 enemy variants with different moveset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of weapons and perks, over 100 weapons and over 60 perks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless huge dungeons with multiple landscapes that regenerate each time</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-7260U 2.2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Simulation"],"developers":["Cydream"],"publishers":["Cydream"],"release_date":"1 Jun, 2023"}